The symbolic proof now closes in about two seconds and prints `#Top`. Concrete execution also returns the expected results, including an actual embedded newline. I’m packaging those exact regeneration, compilation, six runtime checks, and proof commands into `prove.sh`, then I’ll run that script end-to-end as the final reproducibility check.
